# ── .NET build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.user
*.suo
